docs {
  # GET /api/v1/mbg-crisis

  The MBG (Makan Bergizi Gratis) crisis dashboard payload. Reads from Postgres
  (source of truth), cached ~45s in Redis; the live USD/IDR rate is overlaid
  onto the market ticker after the cache.

  **Source:** `apps/web/app/api/v1/mbg-crisis/route.ts`
  **Auth:** `requireRole("viewer")` — needs the `atlas_session` cookie (run *Auth Login* first).
  **Needs:** local Postgres (127.0.0.1:55432) + Redis running.

  ## Response (200) — `DashboardData` (abridged)
  ```json
  {
    "score": 6.4, "emoji": "🟠", "level": "Krisis",
    "article_count": 128, "high_crisis_count": 23,
    "updated_at": "28 Mei, 22.10", "ai_status": "ready",
    "insight": { "title": "...", "text": "...", "action": "..." },
    "predictions": [ { "question": "...", "probability": 78, "answer_label": "...", "reasoning": "..." } ],
    "market_ticker": [ { "label": "USD/IDR", "value": "16.250", "delta": 0.3 } ],
    "top_keywords": [ { "keyword": "keracunan", "count": 42, "sentiment": "negative" } ],
    "city_map_points": [ { "city_key": "Bekasi|Jawa Barat", "lat": -6.24, "lng": 106.99, "heat": 8, "severity_sum": 24, "article_count": 9, "dominant_issue": "keracunan" } ],
    "top_cities": [ ... ], "articles": [ ... ],
    "actor_thread_analysis": { "actors": [ ... ], "summary": { ... } },
    "leadership_sentiment": { "leaders": [ ... ], "ai_available": true }
  }
  ```
  **401** Unauthorized · **403** Forbidden (role too low)
}
